	(text "TLV62569 (SLVSDG1C): L = 2.2 uH, COUT 2 x 22 uF for 0.6-1.2 V and 22 uF above 1.8 V (Table 4). EN tied to VIN: both bucks start together, within the\nXU316's 50 ms window. 3.3 V load: about 0.25 A typ, about 0.6 A peak with ESP32 Wi-Fi transmit (2 A buck)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.54 90.1882 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cf5e54bc-4715-5751-af94-027d8a3ef6f8")
	)
